flowchart TD
    A[User] --> B[Go Login Portal]
    B --> C{Enter Credentials}
    C --> D[POST /login]
    D --> E[Go Backend]
    E --> F[Validate Input]
    F --> G[(User Database)]
    G --> H{Credentials Valid?}

    H -->|No| I[Return Login Error]
    I --> B

    H -->|Yes| J[Generate Session / JWT]
    J --> K[Set Secure Cookie]
    K --> L[Redirect to Dashboard]

    L --> M{Authenticated Request}
    M --> N[Go Auth Middleware]
    N --> O{Valid Session / JWT?}

    O -->|No| B
    O -->|Yes| P[Protected Route]
    P --> Q[Dashboard / User Resources]